[00:00.000] 作词 : Aoife Anson-O’Connell/Reuben Haycocks/Paddy Murphy/Jimmy Bradbury
[00:01.000] 作曲 : Aoife Anson-O’Connell/Reuben Haycocks/Paddy Murphy/Jimmy Bradbury
[00:09.924]If you can only nod
[00:17.397]Sat cross-legged on the bed
[00:24.584]Don't fight this thing you try to stop
[00:30.665]And just quit while you're ahead
[00:35.592]
[00:37.633]As awful as it feels
[00:43.997]Nothing good comes out of comfort
[00:50.763]We've known each other so well so long
[00:56.757]I can't imagine you don't see that
[01:02.127]
[01:07.514]It's as if I didn't know
[01:14.032]The delicate wires we balance on
[01:20.412]I make you squeamish, and it shows
[01:26.254]And I can't do that for too long
[01:31.954]
[01:32.879]Throw your coins into a well
[01:39.128]And pretty soon the water tastes like copper
[01:45.678]And if wishing made some sense
[01:49.987]This conversation wouldn't matter
[01:55.501]
[02:00.149]Now I'll leave you alone
[02:07.647]Now I'm sure that it is best
[02:14.356]Please take my leaving as "I love you"
[02:20.737]As my last leaving promise
